    "<p>[광진구육아종합지원센터] 대체교사 채용 공고</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*첨부파일 확인바랍니다</p>": 3,
    "<p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">2026년도 10월~2월까지 함께할 담임교사를 모집합니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">1. 모집부분 : 0세반 담임교사</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;- 보육교사 2급이상 자격증 소지자&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">- 급여 : 국공립 보육교사 호봉에 준함&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">2. 전형절차&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">- 접수방법 : 이메일접수 garosucc@hanmail.net(‘담임교사’ 지원으로 접수해 주세요)</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;- 면접과정 : 서류전형 합격자에 한해 개별연락&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">* 접수기간내에도 면접이 진행될 수 있으며 , 채용마감될 수 있음&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">3. 제출서류&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">- 이력서 (3개월 이내 사진필수), 자기소개서 1부&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">* 2 년이상 미종사자의 경우 ‘장기미종사자교육 이수증 ’ 필수&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.75px;\"><span style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; font-size: 16px;\">* 제출서류는 일체 반환되지 않습니다 .&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"max-height: 1e+06px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; ba